The '''Greth Lan-Dwu Corp. electrical power-generating plant''' was a [[Greth Lan-Dwu Corp.]] facility in [[Coruscant]] which generated electricity for Coruscant. [[Bounty hunter]] [[Zam Wesell]] fired upon the [[power coupling]]s in an attempt to electrocute [[Jedi]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and [[Anakin Skywalker]] during their [[Plot to assassinate Senator Amidala|pursuit]] of the bounty hunter.<ref name="SWCL2016" />

